@startuml

title Register a Return - Activity Diagram

|Member|
start
:Bring back the book copy;

|Librarian|
:Receive the returned copy;

|System|
:Retrieve loan information;
:Close the loan;

if (Return is late?) then (Yes)
    :Suspend the member;
else (No)
    :Continue normal return;
endif

if (Book is reserved?) then (Yes)
    :Keep the copy aside;
    :Identify the member;
    :Send notification;
else (No)
    :Make the copy available;
endif

|Librarian|
:Complete the return operation;

stop

@enduml